Previously I was thinking of two autogroup directives - begin and end.
However I expect it to be more purposeful/intentional to include a
third possibility specifically for adding to an existing group - add.
It would reduce chances of accidentally adding modules to an existing
group when a completely new group was intended.

The directives (or data objects - still undecided which yet) would then
become:
